  "details": "Recently we've gotten great creator tools with VRC+, like Camera Dolly/Drone and prints, so now I want to see more of them. I want tools for recording and playing back animations on my avatars, and also posing them. People are already doing it with ShaderMotion https://gitlab.com/lox9973/ShaderMotion and AvatarPoseSystem https://booth.pm/en/items/5989814 . The problem with these is that they need to be added to each avatar individually, and the take up precious performance rank/parameter space. I would happily pay for VRC+ if these were added to it as native tools.\n\nRelated: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/ability-to-recordfreeze-clones-of-avatars-locally",
